* Maintain the Society''s polished public image
* Ensure the Gourmand''s offerings remain worthy of its clientele', '', NULL, NULL, NULL),
('greaser_character', '', 'A street thug belonging to the Greasers gang, loyal to Greasy Johnny and entrenched in the North sewers', 'The Greasers are a small gang of street toughs operating under the leadership of Greasy Johnny, having claimed the North sewers as their territory by 2281. They emerged from the margins of New Vegas sprawl, drawn together by shared desperation and the magnetism of Johnny''s swagger. Their presence in the sewers gives them a strategic bolt-hole from which they launch harassment raids against the residents of North Vegas Square, shaking down locals and asserting dominance over anyone too weak to push back. Life in the tunnels is grim and corrosive, but the gang''s identity offers belonging and a crude sense of power that the wasteland otherwise denies them. Each member swears loyalty to Johnny''s vision of greaser supremacy, even if that vision extends no further than the next shakedown.', 'Human male or female; typically a lean, scrappy build with slicked-back hair, grime-smudged skin, minor scars, and a menacing slouching posture.', 'Territorial, aggressive, and pack-minded; brave in numbers but prone to bolting when the odds turn; fiercely loyal to gang identity and quick to intimidate outsiders', '{"Greasy Johnny":{"aff":65,"type":"fanatical","relation":"gang leader","note":"Follows Johnny''s lead without question, drawn by his charisma and the power he represents","best":"Standing at Johnny''s side during a successful shakedown, feeling untouchable","worst":"Being dismissed or mocked by Johnny in front of the other gang members"},"Greasers":{"aff":55,"type":"platonic","relation":"gang brothers and sisters","note":"Pack loyalty runs deep; the gang is family, identity, and protection all at once","best":"Raising hell together in the sewers, voices echoing off the tunnels","worst":"Watching a fellow Greaser get cut down and knowing the pack couldn''t protect them"},"North Vegas Square residents":{"aff":-40,"type":"contempt","relation":"harassment targets","note":"Views the locals as easy marks and rightful prey beneath the gang''s boot heels"}}', 'Gang member and sewer-based enforcer for the Greasers', '* Street fighting
* Intimidation
