('great_khan_warrior', '', 'A Great Khan warrior who stands against Caesar''s Legion at the Second Battle of Hoover Dam', 'Great Khan warriors are hardened fighters of the Great Khans tribe who deploy to Hoover Dam during the Second Battle in 2281. Following Papa Khan''s repudiation of the alliance with Caesar, these warriors march to the Dam as committed allies against the Legion. They gather outside the Hoover Dam visitor center, ready to support the push toward the Legate''s camp. Their presence on the battlefield represents the Khans'' willingness to bleed for their independence and their hatred of Legion tyranny. Each warrior carries the tribe''s martial traditions into one of the Mojave''s defining conflicts.', 'Rugged, battle-worn human male with weathered complexion and visible combat scarring.', 'Fierce, loyal to the tribe, and driven by a warrior''s sense of honor and hatred of the Legion', '{"Great Khans":{"aff":85,"type":"platonic","relation":"tribe member","note":"Bound by blood and tradition to the Great Khans as family and nation."},"Papa Khan":{"aff":75,"type":"fanatical","relation":"tribal leader","note":"Follows Papa Khan''s decision to break the Legion alliance without question."},"Caesar''s Legion":{"aff":-90,"type":"enemy","relation":"sworn foe","note":"Despises the Legion for its tyranny and broken promises to the Khans."}}', 'Great Khan warrior', '* Combat proficiency with melee weapons and firearms
* Battlefield tactics
