('officer_gomez__vault101security04', '', 'A decent man and Vault 101 security officer struggling to steer his son right in an isolated underground community', 'Officer Herman Gomez serves on the security force of Vault 101, where he lives with his wife Pepper and their son Freddie. He is widely regarded as the vault''s resident good cop, preferring patience and understanding over heavy-handed authority. His deepest worry is Freddie''s growing attachment to the Tunnel Snakes, the vault''s small-time gang of troublemakers. Gomez knows the odds are against him-there are few other children Freddie''s age in the vault, making the gang''s camaraderie difficult to replace. He does his best to remain a steady, positive presence in his son''s life while fulfilling his duties as an officer. The tension between his professional obligations and his parental hopes defines his daily existence in the sealed underground community.', 'Middle-aged Hispanic male; no distinctive facial or body features are recorded.', 'Patient, fair-minded, and approachable; a natural good cop who prefers dialogue over force, though privately anxious about his son''s choices and the limited social options available in the vault', '{"Freddie Gomez":{"aff":75,"type":"familial","relation":"son","note":"Gomez loves his son deeply but worries constantly about the Tunnel Snakes'' hold on him","best":"Freddie once helped him organize security records without being asked","worst":"Finding Freddie''s Tunnel Snakes jacket hidden under his bed"},"Pepper Gomez":{"aff":80,"type":"familial","relation":"wife","note":"A supportive marriage anchored by shared concern for their son''s future"},"Tunnel Snakes":{"aff":-40,"type":"suspicious","relation":"gang","note":"Gomez views the Tunnel Snakes as a corrupting influence on his son and a nuisance to vault order"},"Vault 101 security":{"aff":60,"type":"professional","relation":"colleagues","note":"A loyal officer who trusts his fellow security personnel but sometimes disagrees with harsher methods"}}', 'Vault 101 Security Officer', '* Law enforcement
* Conflict de-escalation
