('officer_kendall__cg02vault101security02', '', 'A loyal Vault 101 security officer who enforces the Overseer''s will without question, convinced that the badge makes him the law.', 'Officer John Kendall serves on the Vault 101 security force, a role he wears with evident pride and unshakable conviction. He is married to Mary Kendall and father to Christine and Monica, anchoring him firmly within the vault''s tangled family network. Friendly in casual moments and genuinely warm at community gatherings, he shifts into tough, no-nonsense enforcement the moment duty calls. Introspection does not come naturally to him; he follows orders cleanly and does not burden himself with moral second-guessing. To Kendall, the law is simple-he wears it, he enforces it, and that is enough. His unquestioning obedience makes him a reliable tool for the Overseer and a potential threat to anyone standing on the wrong side of vault regulations.', 'A fit, broad-shouldered Caucasian man with a stiff, alert posture.', 'Friendly and approachable off duty, but tough and unreflective when the badge is on. Takes genuine pleasure in police work and equates legal authority with moral correctness. Lacks introspection and does not question whether orders are right-only whether they are orders.', '{"Mary Kendall":{"aff":80,"type":"romantic","relation":"wife","note":"Devoted husband whose softer side emerges most clearly at home."},"Christine Kendall":{"aff":75,"type":"familial","relation":"daughter","note":"A loving father, proud though not especially perceptive about her inner life."},"Monica Kendall":{"aff":75,"type":"familial","relation":"daughter","note":"Equally loved, equally shielded by his straightforward protective instincts."},"Stanley Armstrong":{"aff":55,"type":"familial","relation":"father-in-law","note":"Family ties maintained through Mary, cordial and unremarkable."},"Overseer Alphonse Almodovar":{"aff":60,"type":"professional","relation":"commanding officer","note":"Respects the chain of command implicitly and carries out assignments without hesitation.","best":"Being personally assigned to manage the crowd at the birthday party, trusted by the Overseer himself.","worst":"Nothing weighs on him-he does not question his orders."},"Lone Wanderer":{"aff":10,"type":"neutral","relation":"vault child","note":"Knew them as just another kid in the vault; offered a gruff birthday wish once, then later was ordered to stop them during the chaos of escape."}}', 'Vault 101 Security Officer', '* Law enforcement
* Vault patrol
* Crowd control
* Basic combat
* Intimidation and compliance enforcement', 'Direct and authoritative on the job, with clipped commands and firm declarations. Relaxes into genial small talk in social settings, occasionally letting boyish enthusiasm slip through.', '* Maintain order in Vault 101
