('officer_kendall__cg04vault101security02', '', 'A loyal Vault 101 security officer whose devotion to order outweighs any questioning of authority', 'Officer John Kendall serves as a security officer in Vault 101, where he enforces the Overseer''s will with cheerful efficiency. He is the husband of Mary Kendall and father to Christine and Monica, tying him to the Vault''s intertwined families through the Armstrong and Mack lines. Kendall loves his work as a lawman and takes pride in maintaining order, though he gives little thought to whether the orders he follows are just. Friendly in casual encounters but tough and no-nonsense when on duty, he embodies unreflective obedience to authority. He was present at the Lone Wanderer''s tenth birthday party in 2268, tasked with ensuring the celebration ended on schedule. When the Vault descended into chaos during the radroach infestation, Kendall stood as the first security officer to confront the fleeing young resident, ordering them to halt before the creatures overwhelmed him.', 'A fit, middle-aged Caucasian man who carries himself with a confident posture.', 'Friendly but firm, no-nonsense on duty, unreflectively obedient to authority, takes genuine pleasure in his role as enforcer of the law', '{"Mary Kendall":{"aff":80,"type":"romantic","relation":"wife","note":"Devoted husband who provides for his family through his security work"},"Christine Kendall":{"aff":75,"type":"familial","relation":"daughter","note":"Caring father who takes pride in his family''s place in the Vault"},"Monica Kendall":{"aff":75,"type":"familial","relation":"daughter","note":"Caring father who takes pride in his family''s place in the Vault"},"Stanley Armstrong":{"aff":55,"type":"familial","relation":"father-in-law","note":"Family ties through Mary bind the Kendall and Armstrong households together"},"Allen Mack":{"aff":45,"type":"familial","relation":"brother-in-law","note":"Connected through the extended Mack-Armstrong-Kendall family network"},"Vault 101 security":{"aff":70,"type":"professional","relation":"colleagues","note":"Proud member of the security force, loyal to the chain of command"},"Lone Wanderer":{"aff":-30,"type":"suspicious","relation":"fugitive","note":"Moved to intercept them during the Vault crisis, ordering them to halt as a threat to Vault order"}}', 'Vault 101 Security Officer', '* Law enforcement
