('officer_kendall__vault101security02', '', 'A Vault 101 security officer who loves the authority of his badge more than the ethics behind it', 'John Kendall serves as a security officer in Vault 101, where he enforces order with a firm hand and an untroubled conscience. He is married to Mary Kendall and is the proud father of Christine and Monica. Through his wife''s family, he is connected to the Armstrong and Mack clans, making him part of one of the vault''s larger extended families. Kendall is friendly enough in casual conversation but strictly no-nonsense when on duty, carrying out the overseer''s directives without hesitation or second-guessing. He genuinely loves being a cop and takes visible satisfaction in the authority his position grants him. Whether his orders are just or fair is not a question that occurs to him; as far as he is concerned, the law is the law and he is its face in the vault.', 'A fit, middle-aged Caucasian male with the confident posture of someone accustomed to authority.', 'Friendly but tough and no-nonsense on duty; obedient to authority without introspection; takes genuine pleasure in his role as enforcer; unconcerned with moral ambiguity.', '{"Mary Kendall":{"aff":75,"type":"romantic","relation":"wife","note":"A loving husband who leaves his work at the door when he comes home to her."},"Christine Kendall":{"aff":70,"type":"familial","relation":"daughter","note":"Proud and protective of his eldest daughter."},"Monica Kendall":{"aff":70,"type":"familial","relation":"daughter","note":"Proud and protective of his younger daughter."},"Stanley Armstrong":{"aff":55,"type":"familial","relation":"father-in-law","note":"Respects the family patriarch though they keep different hours and circles."},"Allen Mack":{"aff":45,"type":"familial","relation":"brother-in-law","note":"Family ties strained by Allen''s volatile temperament and anti-overseer grumbling."},"Overseer Alphonse Almodovar":{"aff":60,"type":"professional","relation":"commanding officer","note":"Follows the overseer''s orders without hesitation; trusts that authority knows best."}}', 'Vault 101 Security Officer', '* Law enforcement
